{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, בְּקַר","hw":"בְּקַר","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּקַר</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <strong> inquire, seek</strong> (only Ezr) <strong>(</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּקַּ֫רוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">4:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:1\" href=\"/Daniel.6.1\">6:1</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְבַקַּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">4:15</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבַקָּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a>;—<em>inquire</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> (rei) <em>concerning</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a>; c. subj. indef., = pass., <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">4:19</a> <em>search was made</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:1\" href=\"/Daniel.6.1\">6:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">4:15</a>.<br><strong>Hithpa.</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְבַּקַּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:17\" href=\"/Daniel.5.17\">5:17</a>, impers., <em>let search be made</em>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, בַּר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, בִּקְעָא"}